    <h1 class="post-title">Nutrition Science Update: Latest Dietary Research Findings</h1>
    <div class="post-meta">
      <time datetime="2026-05-10T00:00:00+01:00">
        May 10, 2026
      </time>
      
        <span class="post-author">By WeSearchAI Team</span>
      
      
        <span class="post-categories">
          
